[00:30.86]1. Glorious Jehovah, almighty, eternal,
[00:40.24]Perfect in justice, in power, in love.
[00:48.04]Source of all truth and of infinite wisdom,
[00:55.30]You rule as Sov’reign in heaven above.
[01:03.86]We as your people delight in your service;
[01:11.90]Your Kingdom truth we delight to proclaim.
[01:24.12](Chorus)
[01:24.12]Being your Witnesses, great is our priv’lege.
[01:32.02]Oh, may we ever live up to our name!
[01:49.10]2. Working together in your sacred service
[01:56.74]Binds us as brothers in love and in peace.
[02:05.80]Teaching the truth and reflecting your glory
[02:12.74]Fill us with joy as your praises increase.
[02:21.72]Known by your name, O Jehovah, our Father,
[02:30.70]We have the honor to add to your fame.
[02:39.04](Chorus)
[02:39.94]Being your Witnesses, great is our priv’lege.
[02:51.50]Oh, may we ever live up to our name!
